(geodetic-init)
*title Coordinate initialization equivalence
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=0 long=0 lat=0 vel=100 gama=0 psi=90 time=0 mass=1
  *file coordinate.dat time xecfc yecfc zecfc xecfcdt yecfcdt zecfcdt alt long latgd vel gamgd psigd
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *when time=10 stop
*end
